      "tool_uses": [],
      "assistant_text": "According to the [[credential-scoping]] page, the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process**, immediately before that process starts. Specifically:\n\n- A local secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup\n- It injects the key only into the environment of the spawned Ingest agent child process (and similarly for the Query agent)\n- The Hub\u0027s own process environment is never mutated\n\nThis approach ensures that the Hub process itself never holds the credential \u2014 the key exists only inside the short-lived child process that actually calls the Anthropic API, preventing a compromised Hub process from leaking the credential simply by inspecting its own environment variables.",
